---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Case Study: Eco Car Wreckers — Automotive Lead Gen | GeekBytes"
  description="How GeekBytes built a lead-generating WordPress site for Eco Car Wreckers that ranks on page 1 in NSW for 'cash for cars' keywords and drives daily inbound enquiries."
>
  <main class="bg-brand-black text-brand-white min-h-screen">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="pt-32 pb-16 px-4">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <a href="/#projects" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-accent text-sm mb-8 hover:underline">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"/></svg>
          Back to Portfolio
        </a>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5">
          <span class="text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-brand-accent/50 text-brand-accent">Automotive</span>
          <span class="text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/20 text-gray-400">WordPress</span>
          <span class="text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/20 text-gray-400">SEO</span>
          <span class="text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/20 text-gray-400">Lead Gen</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">Eco Car Wreckers</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          From zero digital presence to page-1 Google rankings — how we built a lead machine for a Sydney car wrecking business.
        </p>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mt-8">
          <a
            href="https://ecocarwreckers.com.au/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-accent text-white font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm hover:bg-brand-accent/90 transition-colors"
          >
            Visit Live Site
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V8a2 2 0 012-2h6"/><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Stats bar -->
    <section class="border-y border-white/10 py-10 px-4">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-accent">Top 5</p>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">NSW Google rankings for 'cash for cars' terms</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-accent">3×</p>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">increase in inbound enquiries vs. previous site</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-accent">6 wks</p>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">from brief to live site</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Body -->
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 space-y-14">

      <!-- Challenge -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">The Challenge</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Eco Car Wreckers had been operating in the Sydney metropolitan area for years but relied almost entirely on word-of-mouth and a basic directory listing. Their old website had no SEO structure, no clear call-to-action, and loaded slowly on mobile — the device used by the vast majority of people searching for "cash for cars" in a hurry.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mt-4">
          The goal was straightforward: rank for high-intent local keywords and turn those visitors into phone calls and form submissions the same day.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- What we built -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">What We Built</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-accent/10 border border-brand-accent/30 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-accent shrink-0 mt-0.5">1</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-brand-white font-semibold">Instant Vehicle Valuation Tool</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">A simple on-page form where visitors enter their vehicle make, model, year, and condition to get an instant cash offer estimate. This dramatically reduces friction for the most common visitor intent.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-accent/10 border border-brand-accent/30 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-accent shrink-0 mt-0.5">2</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-brand-white font-semibold">Local SEO Architecture</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">Dedicated suburb-level landing pages targeting search terms like "car wreckers Parramatta" and "scrap car removal Liverpool NSW" — each with unique content, schema markup, and Google Maps embeds.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-accent/10 border border-brand-accent/30 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-accent shrink-0 mt-0.5">3</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-brand-white font-semibold">Mobile-First, Click-to-Call Design</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">A persistent sticky header with a phone number CTA visible on every page scroll position, built specifically for mobile users who want to call immediately without navigating a contact page.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-accent/10 border border-brand-accent/30 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-accent shrink-0 mt-0.5">4</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-brand-white font-semibold">Google Business Profile Integration</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">Structured data and citation consistency across the site to reinforce Google Business Profile signals and improve local pack visibility for Sydney-area searches.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Tech stack -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Tech Stack</h2>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          {["WordPress", "Elementor Pro", "Yoast SEO", "WPForms", "Google Search Console", "Google Business Profile"].map(tech => (
            <span class="text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-white/15 text-gray-300">{tech}</span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Results -->
      <section class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Results</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Within 3 months of launch, Eco Car Wreckers was ranking on the first page of Google for multiple "cash for cars" and "car wreckers [suburb]" keywords across NSW. The on-page quote form became the primary channel for new customer acquisition, replacing the previous reliance on directory referrals.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mt-4">
          Inbound enquiry volume tripled compared to the previous site, with the majority coming from mobile users discovering the site via local search.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <section class="text-center pt-4">
        <p class="text-gray-400 mb-6">Need a lead-gen website for your automotive or trade business?</p>
        <a href="/#contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-accent text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-brand-accent/90 transition-colors">
          Get a Free Consultation
        </a>
      </section>

    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
